category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgtest-devel
sdesc: "RFC 3986 compliant URI parser library (utilities)"
ldesc: "uriparser is a strictly RFC 3986 compliant URI parsing and handling library
written in C. uriparser is cross-platform, fast, supports Unicode and is
licensed under the New BSD license."
